愛想忘れてご苦労様 私とあなたでせーの
Good grief on forgetting your friendliness, you and I together, ready, set—

513
00:50:22,403 --> 00:50:23,923
燃え 燃え 燃え 燃え
burn, burn, burn, burn!

514
00:50:24,103 --> 00:50:29,093
こんなんで誰が喜ぶのさ ネオ教えて 笑顔でアップップ
Who could possibly be happy with this? Neo, teach me, smile and up-up-up!

515
